{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"agent_message","text":"The draft now covers a five-garden campaign, a controller-friendly maze workshop, and both co-op paths. It also addresses two integration details that could otherwise cause trouble: AI Hub’s host can have no local player, and the engine’s attract mode defaults to 20 seconds, so the game must explicitly use 10. I’m checking coverage and validating the two files now.\n"}}
